-/-!
-# BFEquiv is Borel on the Pair Space
-
-This file proves that the back-and-forth equivalence relation `BFEquiv α` is
-measurable (Borel) on the pair space `StructureSpace L × StructureSpace L`
-for `α < ω₁`.
