-For a symbol of `localSkolem L Γ` — that is, a formula `φ ∈ Γ` of arity `n+1` — the witness body of
-`∃ xₙ, φ` is `φ[skolemTerm]`, built with the template pattern `openBounds → subst → relabel` exactly
