-`IndexCoding.comp_pad`, with no decoder analysis. -/
-theorem reindex_trans (c₁ : IndexCoding ι κ) (c₂ : IndexCoding κ μ) :
-    ∀ {n} (φ : L.BoundedFormulaInf ι α n),
